dableEq.{u_1 + 1} α] → α → Multiset.{u_1} α → Multiset.{u_1} α","unsafe":false,"value":48,"source":{"code":"/-- `ndinsert a s` is the lift of the list `insert` operation. This operation\n  does not respect multiplicities, unlike `cons`, but it is suitable as\n  an insert operation on `Finset`. -/\ndef ndinsert (a : α) (s : Multiset α) : Multiset α :=\n  Quot.liftOn s (fun l => (l.insert a : Multiset α)) fun _ _ p => Quot.sound (p.insert a)","start":34,"end":38},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}